flowchart TB
  Start["Evidence owner<br/>admit roots, queries, limits and one UTC anchor"] --> Scope{"Each repo's sole declared scope"}
  Scope -->|"full"| Files["Allowed source files<br/>Git optional"]
  Scope -->|"dirty / recent dirty"| Dirty["Scoped staged, unstaged and untracked candidates"]
  Dirty --> Time{"Recency requested?"}
  Time -->|"no"| Capture
  Time -->|"yes"| Recent["Present-file mtime filter<br/>unknown dates follow explicit policy"]
  Scope -->|"refs / commit set / commit window"| History["Resolved commit and parent sides<br/>bounded history coverage"]
  Scope -->|"union"| Union["Resolve each member<br/>retain layer and revision provenance"]
  Files --> Capture["Capture before/after bytes and identities<br/>never substitute later live text"]
  Recent --> Capture
  History --> Capture
  Union --> Capture
  Capture --> Stable{"Relevant capture stable?"}
  Stable -->|"mutation / source unavailable"| Refuse["Preparation diagnostic<br/>affected required evidence incomplete"]
  Stable -->|"yes"| Units["Map changed spans to syntax units<br/>before deletions remain attributable"]
  Units --> Related["Bounded related-source discovery<br/>unchanged files allowed inside supplied paths"]
  Related --> Seal{"All used mutable captures still stable?"}
  Seal -->|"no"| Refuse
  Seal -->|"yes"| Out["Frozen plan with complete or partial groups<br/>rules owner requires complete nonempty required context"]
